- "Utrecht vs Borodino at 12 km: At 12 km against a broadside Borodino, load AP: it penetrates, detonating inside the hull, on 37% of the hull it strikes. It penetrates most of the bow (64%), casemate (61%) and stern (64%), and ricochets off the superstructure and shatters on the citadel armor and turrets. Aim at those zones rather than the superstructure."
- "Des Moines vs Borodino at 12 km: At 12 km against a broadside Borodino, load AP: it penetrates, detonating inside the hull, on 26% of the hull it strikes. It penetrates most of the casemate (59%) and citadel armor (73%), and ricochets off the superstructure, bow and stern and shatters on the turrets. It also detonates inside Borodino's citadel on 18% of the rays over it. Aim at those zones rather than the superstructure."
- "Zao vs Borodino at 12 km: At 12 km against a broadside Borodino, load AP: it penetrates, detonating inside the hull, on 31% of the hull it strikes. It penetrates most of the casemate (66%), citadel armor (100%) and turrets (51%), and overpenetrates the bow and ricochets off the superstructure and stern. A hit through a turret's armor can knock the turret out. It also detonates inside Borodino's citadel on 38% of the rays over it. Aim at those zones rather than the superstructure."
- "Des Moines vs Des Moines at 8 km: At 8 km against a broadside Des Moines, load AP: it penetrates, detonating inside the hull, on 15% of the hull it strikes. It penetrates most of the citadel armor (100%) and turrets (68%), and overpenetrates the superstructure, stern and bow and ricochets off the casemate. A hit through a turret's armor can knock the turret out. It also detonates inside Des Moines's citadel on 25% of the rays over it. Aim at those zones rather than the superstructure."
- "Des Moines vs Yamato at 12 km: At 12 km against a broadside Yamato, load HE: AP penetrates on only 11% of the hull it strikes; the rest overpenetrates, ricochets or shatters. It overpenetrates the bow, ricochets off the superstructure, stern and casemate and shatters on the turrets and citadel armor. HE defeats the first plate on 64% of the area it strikes (superstructure, stern, bow and casemate), and every HE hit can start a fire, even one that shatters. At 4 km, load AP instead."
